  "P50_DECISION": "P20 too aggressive as L1->L2 boundary; K100/fusion P20->P50 recovered ~5-10pp primary gold cov for ~2.5x scope; P_MAIN=50 (~5k cand/query) is the frozen L1->L2 interface. Do not retune P during L2.",
  "ANY_VS_ALL": "ANY_GOLD_COV = >=1 gold survives L1; ALL_GOLD_COV = all supporting golds survive. High ANY / lower ALL => partial evidence. Distinguish (A) within-scope reasoning failure from (B) L1 pruning failure. Under strict induced-P50, a gold pruned by L1 is UNRECOVERABLE; L3 must not silently reintroduce the full corpus. Bounded frontier expansion = explicit future L3 experiment.",
